15	/**
16	 * Audit sink: appends one record per line to a KNOWN FILE (app.audit.file, default .run/audit.log)
17	 * so tests can assert side-effects by reading that file — the second test-assertion channel
18	 * alongside the UI. The file path + one-record-per-line format is a stable contract, like
19	 * data-testid: features may be rewritten as long as they keep emitting the agreed records.
20	 *
21	 * Inject this bean into any feature that must record an audit entry. Each write flushes (append +
22	 * SYNC) so a test reads the record immediately.
23	 */
